github.com/crow-hq/llm-wiki-v2), AGPL-3.0-or-later. Its four answers were recorded from llmwiki2 0.8.0
(see tools/record-demo.sh).

The screenshots and recordings of Crow in assets/img/shots and assets/media come from crow-hq/crow-desktop and
crow-hq/llm-wiki-v2; the films in assets/films are the authors' own.

